 Will you rise to the challenge or be swept away by the tides of fate?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098420/extras/985b6a2789e9371717830a93ababc3b7.poster.avif?t=1772055061\" width=780 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098420/extras/985b6a2789e9371717830a93ababc3b7.webm?t=1772055061\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How to Fix the Future is a gripping, story-driven sci-fi visual novel. Spanning the present, a dystopian post-apocaliptic future and the past, this tale weaves together mystery, lust, romance, and high-stakes adventure, where every choice crafts a unique path through a world on the brink of transformation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098420/extras/e4a1181e1aa1a38294655a195c6ff624.poster.avif?t=1772055061\" width=780 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098420/extras/e4a1181e1aa1a38294655a195c6ff624.webm?t=1772055061\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 7000 Full-HD renders.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 250 Full-HD animations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 cinematics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 130 music tracks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >108 sound effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 30 lewd scenes(all optional, tailored to your preferences).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wide range of fetishes,